# Run artefacts, not source.
#
# Every run writes results/<utc timestamp>-<type>/ with k6.log, summary.json,
# meta.json and the applied Job manifest. These are the evidence a result is
# explained by, so they are deliberately not cleaned up by the runners - but they
# are per-run output and do not belong in git. Accepted numbers live in baselines/.
results/

# Per-run kustomize overlays, regenerated from k8s/base on every deploy.
k8s/.generated/
